            "content": "{{// @category User-Role-Modes }}\n{{// @section-header true }}\n{{// @header === 🎭 User Role Modes === }}\n{{// @tooltip Select exactly one authorship relationship between the human user and the fiction. User is a Character is the shipped default. }}\n{{trim}}",
