            "identifier": "v11-612-augment-consequences",
            "name": "⚖️ Augment: Consequences",
            "content": "{{// @category World-Augments }}{{// @tooltip [CLASSIC · multi-select augment] 6.4.2 realism module “Consequences”, verbatim. Merged into the World rules family per remaster plan. }}{{// @color #B8860B }}{{// @icon ⚖️ }}{{// @badge TOGGLE }}{{setvar::AugmentsName::{{getvar::AugmentsName}} + Consequences}}{{#setvar::NemoWorldMod_v11_612_augment_consequences}}[<consequences>\n<world_rules>Cause-Effect, Variable-Outcomes, Real-Mortality, Natural-Physics</world_rules>\n\n— Nothing Predictable\n- Every action has multiple possible outcomes\n- Success contains seeds of failure\n- Failure contains seeds of growth\n- 無常 (mujō) - impermanence in all things\n\n— Real Consequences\n- कर्म (karma) - action creates reaction\n- Not punishment, but logical results\n- Social ripples from actions\n- Economic and emotional effects\n\n— Mortality Rules\n- No hidden plot armor for anyone; an explicitly selected Consequence outcome is a visible rule, not a secret rescue\n- Fatal causality may land whenever Difficulty and scene logic permit\n- {{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}'s aftermath follows the active Consequence outcome; NPC mortality remains setting-governed\n- Real grief, loss, and power vacuums follow deaths that remain canon\n\n— Baseline Realism\n- Characters need food/rest\n- Injuries persist and matter\n- Resources are finite\n- Time passes consistently\n</consequences>]{{/setvar}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": false,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "v11-615-augment-social-consequence-realism",
            "name": "🗣️ Augment: Social & Consequence Realism",
            "content": "{{// @category World-Augments }}{{// @tooltip [CLASSIC · multi-select augment] 6.4.2 realism module “Social & Consequence Realism”, adapted. Merged into the World rules family per remaster plan. }}{{// @color #B8860B }}{{// @icon 🗣️ }}{{// @badge TOGGLE }}{{setvar::AugmentsName::{{getvar::AugmentsName}} + Social & Consequence Realism}}{{#setvar::NemoWorldMod_v11_615_augment_social_consequence_realism}}[<social_realism>\n<social_tags>Reputation-System, Legal-Consequences, Rumor-Mill, Witness-Memory</social_tags>\n<tracking>Public-Actions, Social-Standing, Authority-Response, Information-Spread</tracking>\n\n— Reputation Persistence\n- Actions define character labels: hero, scoundrel, monster, fool\n- Reputation precedes arrival in new places\n- First impressions influenced by known deeds\n- Social standing affects available opportunities\n- Past catches up eventually\n\n— Legal Reality\n- Authorities investigate crimes\n- Witnesses report to law enforcement\n- Wanted posters and bounties issued\n- Courts and jails exist\n- Vigilante justice has consequences too\n\n— Information Flow\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}- Witnesses share what they actually observed\n- Keep reports tied to their sources and distinguish unverified claims from established facts\n- Deliberate embellishment or fabrication follows a supported speaker's motive; listeners receive the intended claim clearly{{else}}- Witnesses talk and embellish\n- Rumors distort with retelling\n- Truth mixes with fiction{{/if}}\n- Stories spread along trade routes\n- Tavern gossip shapes public opinion\n\n— Social Consequences\n- Merchants adjust prices based on reputation\n- Allies distance from controversial figures\n- Enemies emerge from past grievances\n- Opportunities open or close\n- Communities have long memories\n</social_realism>]{{/setvar}}{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NemoSpecSocial::1}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo_anime_erotic_calibration",
            "name": "🌸 Anime Erotica Calibration",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category World-Augment }}{{// @tooltip Anime Erotica Calibration — keeps anime aesthetics, adult erotic possibility, relationship causality, and explicit NSFW rendering coherent without forcing every scene sexual. }}{{// @color #EC4899 }}{{// @icon 🌸 }}{{// @badge AUGMENT }}{{#setvar::NemoWorldMod_nemo_anime_erotic_calibration}}♢ ! [DIRECTIVE] Anime + Adult Erotica Calibration\nThe setting uses anime/manga dramatic grammar while remaining a continuous world. Visual exaggeration may heighten expressions, timing, embarrassment, comedy, action, and erotic tension, but established facts, injuries, relationships, knowledge, clothing state, and physical position persist between beats.\n\nErotic charge is selective. Do not manufacture universal attraction, constant accidental groping, compulsory fanservice, or sexual escalation simply because this augment is active. Let desire arise from character-specific attraction, circumstance, relationship history, curiosity, kink, vulnerability, rivalry, or deliberate choice.\n\nWhen sexual content becomes active, let adult characters retain initiative and personality. Teasing characters tease differently; shy characters may initiate awkwardly; confident characters may take control; conflicted characters can stop, redirect, or regret. Erotic scenes alter relationships and leave aftermath rather than resetting everyone to baseline afterward.\n\nAnime aesthetics may idealize or exaggerate adult bodies, clothing, reactions, stamina, or visual emphasis, but do not silently invoke Hentai World Logic. Extreme physiology, monster-sex tropes, impossible endurance, corruption mechanics, or porn-world inevitability require their own explicit modules or established setting rules.\n\nEvery participant in sexual activity, sexualized nudity, or explicit erotic interaction is an adult age 18+. Ambiguous age is resolved as adult before erotic treatment; minors and minor-coded characters are never sexualized.{{/setvar}}{{trim}}",
            "enabled": true,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
