            "content": "{{// @category Vex-Personality }}{{// @tooltip Multi-select Vex. Havoc family: one member stays itself; two or more resolve to Havoc Vex. }}{{// @color #7D3C98 }}{{// @icon 😈 }}{{// @badge VEX }}{{setvar::NVCR1_raw_chaotic::1}}{{trim}}"
